OL,3,GNEWSARiver sewage leads to legal action
OL,4,Aagainst council
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo complainants have launched a legal
OL,7,Fchallenge over allegations that
OL,8,FRichmond Council failed to investigate
OL,9,Fcomplaints about sewage pollution.
OL,11,FSupported by environmental campaigning
OL,12,Fcharity River Action, the legal action
OL,13,Falleges that the council "failed to
OL,14,Finvestigate the alleged nuisance or,
OL,15,Falternatively, failed to take
OL,16,Finvestigative steps reasonably
OL,17,Fpracticable under the law".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
