OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARiver sewage leads to legal action
OL,4,Aagainst council
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows a complaint made in December
OL,7,F2025 by Eleanor Warren, a rower, and
OL,8,FSuzanne Cave, a Taggs Island resident
OL,9,Fand member of Taggs Island River Watch,
OL,10,Fabout sewage discharges into the
OL,11,FThames.
OL,13,FRichmond Council said the legal
OL,14,Fframework for sewage pollution and
OL,15,Fstatutory nuisance complaints was
OL,16,F"extremely complex".
